["Classical.choice","Quot.sound","propext"],"module":"QuarticQuery.Paper.ConstructionForrelationQuantum","receipt":"corpus/reading_statement_evidence.json","status":"current","type":"∀ (k t : ℕ),\n  1 ≤ k →\n    (∀ (z : QuarticQuery.BitInput (QuarticQuery.ForrelationCoord k t)),\n        QuarticQuery.Forrelation.successProb z = QuarticQuery.Phi k t z ^ 2 ∧\n          (QuarticQuery.P k t z = Option.some Bool.true →\n              QuarticQuery.Forrelation.delta k ^ 2 ≤ QuarticQuery.Forrelation.successProb z) ∧\n            (QuarticQuery.P k t z = Option.some Bool.false →\n              QuarticQuery.Forrelation.successProb z ≤ QuarticQuery.Forrelation.delta k ^ 2 / 4)) ∧\n      (QuarticQuery.Upper.Samples k fun z b => QuarticQuery.Upper.bern (QuarticQuery.Phi k t z ^ 2) b) ∧\n        ∀ [inst : Inhabited (QuarticQuery.ForrelationCoord k t)],\n          QuarticQuery.Upper.Runs (2 * k) fun z b => QuarticQuery.Upper.bern (QuarticQuery.Phi k t z ^ 2) b"},"kind":"theorem","line":26,"note":"It conjoins the Phi² law and promise gaps with k logical reads and a Runs (2*k) physical witness. It does not provide an end-to-end Runs k witness; local phase kickback alone does not close that gap.","open_assumptions":[],"premises":["k≥1."],"reached":false,"relation":"partial","review_binding":{"declaration":"QuarticQuery.Paper.construction_projection_test","judgment_sha256":"4c8ba9553670d636e082b7d2fda831bc12e2a97ce5097d6b7d42bb18c9ebd998","row_sha256":"5ee006e8a971517c92f9c7ff86af1391722c4974a1d9853f15a913d6df21f2b9","schema":"quartic-tie-review-v1","source_snapshot_sha256":"0d109ea9e9b7f4a766640d406409e30589fb4c5a4e645b6d6888569fa2edf29f","statement_id":"claim-proj-prob","statement_sha256":"1ce97979ffc9963d91470bec06ed87fe9a7c7051a5049a7be983f02d779b32f0"},"review_evidence":"current","reviewed_by":"ai:round3-current-source-review","reviewed_relation":"partial","reviewed_route":"same","route":"same","wrapper_comparison_evidence":"not_run"},{"build_evidence":"current","built":true,"comp